WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,080
Cousin, this is the wheelchair Tian Shui sent to the eldest girl of the Song family.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,080
You also know that the prince hates people giving this thing the most.

3
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,080
Smash it if you see it

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,080
I really don’t dare to make the little ones and send them in.

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,080
This is the wish of my future sister-in-law

6
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,080
How dare you stop

7
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:16,140
Push it right in

8
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:19,140
If the prince gets angry, I can't blame you.

9
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,140
My cousin is right, let’s go in

10
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,140
Song family daughter

11
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,140
You rushed to your cousin's sore spot before you even got through the door.

12
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,140
I'd like to see it

13
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:29,140
How will my cousin smash your broken wheelchair today?

14
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:33,307
world grace

15
00:00:33,307 --> 00:00:41,640
This wood is ready

16
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,640
I've obviously made up my mind that I won't use it.

17
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,640
So I cut corners and fooled around with things.

18
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,640
Her thoughts were blinded in vain
